SUMMARY:The Art Of Writing A Novel
DESCRIPTION:This is an intensive training course based on the Professional Writer model. Moreover\, we seek to create a new and unique model in teaching novel writing. This course is designed for novelists\, both beginners and those with experience\, who are interested in learning the basics and methods of novel writing\, developing their skills and who aspire to publish their first works. Throughout this intensive course\, participants will present their own narrative experiences through written novel proposals. They will work on developing and writing these proposals professionally under the supervision of experts and specialized novelists over eight continuous days. This course is distinguished by the num
LOCATION:Ithra - Knowledge Tower - Level 8\, Classroom 2
